sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Client
    participant API as FastAPI<br/>/tenants/{id}/fields/{field_id}
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Abs as build_abstraction<br/>service

    User->>+API: PATCH /tenants/TENANT_ID/fields/annual_base_rent<br/>{value: "125000",<br/>comment: "Confirmed with tenant",<br/>actor: "alice@acme.com"}

    API->>+DB: db.get Tenant
    DB-->>-API: Tenant row
    alt Tenant not found
        API-->>User: 404 tenant not found
    end

    API->>+DB: SELECT FieldOverride<br/>WHERE tenant_id + field_id
    DB-->>-API: existing row OR null

    Note over API: old_value = existing.value<br/>(for audit log)

    alt payload.value is null (clear override)
        API->>+DB: DELETE FieldOverride
        DB-->>-API: ok
        API->>+DB: INSERT AuditLog<br/>action=revert,<br/>old_value=X,<br/>new_value=null,<br/>actor=alice
        DB-->>-API: ok
    else payload.value provided (set/update override)
        alt Override doesn't exist yet
            API->>+DB: INSERT FieldOverride<br/>value, comment, updated_by
            DB-->>-API: ok
        else Override exists
            API->>+DB: UPDATE FieldOverride<br/>value, comment,<br/>updated_by, updated_at
            DB-->>-API: ok
        end
        API->>+DB: INSERT AuditLog<br/>action=override,<br/>old_value, new_value,<br/>actor, timestamp
        DB-->>-API: ok
    end

    API->>+DB: commit
    DB-->>-API: ok

    Note over API,Abs: Return the FULL updated abstraction<br/>so the UI sees the recomputed<br/>concluded_value immediately

    API->>+Abs: build_abstraction(tenant_id)
    Abs->>DB: Fetch all field values, overrides, docs
    DB-->>Abs: data
    Abs->>Abs: For THIS field:<br/>override_present = true<br/>→ concluded_source = 'override'<br/>→ concluded_confidence = 1.0<br/>→ source_document_label = 'Override'
    Abs-->>-API: TenantAbstractionOut

    API-->>-User: 200 OK<br/>full abstraction<br/>with updated field

    Note over User: Later: view audit trail
    User->>+API: GET /tenants/TENANT_ID/audit
    API->>+DB: SELECT * FROM audit_log<br/>WHERE tenant_id<br/>ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    DB-->>-API: rows
    API-->>-User: List of AuditLogOut<br/>showing extract → override<br/>chain per field
